              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خونریزی (khunrizi) — \"bleeding; bloodshed\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پرستار خونریزی را متوقف کرد. Parastâr khunrizi râ motevaqqef kard. The nurse stopped the bleeding."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "khun \"blood\" + rizi \"pouring\", from riz-, the present stem of rikhtan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "khunrizi joins khun \"blood\" and rizi \"pouring\", from rikhtan \"to pour\", which EtymDB traces to Middle Persian. All of it is native Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
