            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "زن از گرما بیهوش شد. Zan az garmâ bihush shod. The woman fainted from the heat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bi \"without\" + hush \"consciousness\". Present bihush mishavad."
            }
