            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او بعد از ده دقیقه به هوش آمد. U ba'd az dah daqiqe be hush âmad. She came round after ten minutes."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally \"to come to consciousness\". Present stem â-: be hush miâyad."
            }
          ]
        },
